OL,4,G0100FBreaking Point
OL,5,     GAfter a violent reaction to his
OL,6,     Genquiries, can jockey Rob Finn
OL,7,     Gsurvive long enough to discover
OL,8,     Gthe truth? Stars Michael Kitchen.
OL,9,G0130FThe Loved One
OL,10,     G4 Extra Debut. 1947: Failed poet
OL,11,     GDennis Barlow disgraces the
OL,12,     GBritish enclave in Hollywood with
OL,13,     Ghis job in a pet cemetery. Stars
OL,14,     GRupert Graves.
OL,15,G0200FHome Again
OL,16,     GFulton meets daughter-in-law,
OL,17,     GCyrilla, for the first time. How
OL,18,     Gwill they get on? Stars Robin
OL,19,     GBailey. From June 1980.
